{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7000_place", "source_sha256": "7d9949f09e9b39ef3eacfd0835b298df6aa8d9c75d4446584715fdb1b9131f71", "ja": "雪原", "zh": "雪原", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7001_p", "source_sha256": "f20ded3ef2f948868257f55d519b0dce30db53999902eb31e45a91ddab75cf9b", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n翼はイエティの衣装を着て撮影をすることに……）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》杂志的拍摄日。\n翼要穿着雪怪的服装进行拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4a0ad5be4003d5250ca01f55b9614d3aeb6bbc49339dd4a186dce23fbe00d8bb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ひどいですよ～！\nイエティって、怖いモンスターじゃないですか～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你太过分了～！\n雪人不是那种很可怕的怪物吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7003_p", "source_sha256": "6fec226b52a4f13027349fefd193c469d8d2930734c83e0b1f5bbd02f691f261", "ja": "えっ、そうだけど……。\nそれにしても、酷いって何がだ？", "zh": "咦，是这样没错……  \n话说回来，你说“过分”到底是指什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "89ccb886d2f8350d10597c8d2184adc1aa84acc6ea73902f6eded9d10965853e", "ja": "衣装がカワイイから、わたしにピッタリだって思った\nのに。怖いモンスターじゃモテモテになれないよ～！", "zh": "明明因为服装很可爱，我还觉得特别适合我呢。变成可怕的怪物可就没人喜欢了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7005_p", "source_sha256": "968e3f8ed03c130168b75c981e080ecefb8f84e00ceff7e04b01b7ce04582322", "ja": "そんなことないぞ。モンスターの怖い姿が撮りたいん\nじゃなくて、可愛らしい姿が撮りたいんだ。", "zh": "才不是那样。我想拍的不是怪物吓人的模样，而是可爱的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7006_p", "source_sha256": "990c87a896d93ed4ac1344b643e90d5fff5785aea04998ee0618ab6b69699e77", "ja": "翼の魅力をもってすれば、\n最高に可愛くて、モテモテなイエティの写真が撮れる！", "zh": "凭翼的魅力，一定能拍出超级可爱、特别受欢迎的雪人照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "456c6f4bc34010f3824718ebda09d43090921461b587a8f32a367ab7a061fdf9", "ja": "……しょうがないなぁ。どうしたらカワイイって\n思ってもらえるか、一緒に考えてくださ～い！", "zh": "……真拿你没办法。要怎样才能让别人觉得可爱呢？请和我一起想想办法嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7008", "source_sha256": "9e19ad0ad7c340a29280a3947404ab4d3c742c3f09e7926c0556299ce38bf610", "ja": "大人しい", "zh": "文静", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7009", "source_sha256": "adc32eb2dfb8d25b20c5fc1a05134bc4fff74e44c3907279ca86c26a3d0f263d", "ja": "元気いっぱい", "zh": "活力满满", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7200_p", "source_sha256": "204cf629edc3ba61347f13904a71d78ddd44120893b60b5cab25b977eac99f24", "ja": "イエティはあまり姿を現さないらしいから、大人しい\n感じはどうだ？　普段の翼とのギャップも出るしな。", "zh": "听说雪人很少露面，文静一点的感觉\n怎么样？这样也能和翼平时的样子形成反差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7201_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aa77e903aeda6ac69ea087820881a7e7b6a2272e276c80f0b85a2e831ef6d8c7", "ja": "たしかに！　いつも明るい子が大人しくなったら\nちょっと気になっちゃいますもんね～。", "zh": "确实！平时很开朗的孩子变得安静了，确实会让人在意呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7202_016tsu", "source_sha256": "73b4dfec2e1d7438220294ff18e05208c52a1f973b82f7785bd534cfc62ee47a", "ja": "……{$P$}さんも気になりますか？\nそれならわたし、頑張ってみようかな～♪", "zh": "……{$P$}先生也会在意吗？\n要是这样的话，那我可要努力试试看喽～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7300_p", "source_sha256": "204cf629edc3ba61347f13904a71d78ddd44120893b60b5cab25b977eac99f24", "ja": "イエティはあまり姿を現さないらしいから、大人しい\n感じはどうだ？　普段の翼とのギャップも出るしな。", "zh": "听说雪人很少露面，文静一点的感觉\n怎么样？这样也能和翼平时的样子形成反差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7301_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fd3fc44e5933b2868255911ca149ce98c30558b2c9c4f148b772d9a7ccb48bd1", "ja": "えー！　でもちゃんとアピールしないと、\nモテモテになるのって難しくないですか？", "zh": "诶——！可是如果不好好表现自己，要变得受欢迎不是很难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7302_016tsu", "source_sha256": "42fa710daf73fafc92e6779e4f12874e0777f0f0b55775530bcf00743b4e89ed", "ja": "大人しくてもみんなに見てもらえる方法……うーん。\nあっ、キレイなお花を持ったらいい感じかも♪", "zh": "就算老老实实的也能被大家关注的办法……嗯——\n啊，拿着漂亮的花朵说不定感觉不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7500_p", "source_sha256": "d8b8316a623017968a53fa44fc0e69fd9f023ff68dc1253400dba8b8dcea0004", "ja": "山の中で暮らすイエティなんだし、元気が一番かな！\nそれに翼らしさもあって魅力的に見えるはずだ。", "zh": "毕竟是生活在山里的雪人，充满活力才是最重要的吧！\n而且这样也很有翼的风格，看起来一定很有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7501_016tsu", "source_sha256": "518ea8f1f0d6f830dbc989aae716f81e06d5c0d39f0c98e85939beda72c036cc", "ja": "い～っぱいアピールしないとモテないですよね♪\nお花をプレゼントしたり、ダンスもいいかも！", "zh": "得好好展现自己才行，不然可不会受欢迎呢♪\n比如送花当礼物，跳舞好像也很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7502_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cf8691d9c638ee64bb084fba6683fa9a89ed27bffbcdd5012446fced5f6e9b87", "ja": "なんだか、カワイくてモテモテのイエティになれる\n気がしてきたかも！　撮影、頑張っちゃいまーす♪", "zh": "总觉得自己好像能变成可爱又超受欢迎的雪怪了！  \n拍摄时，我会好好加油的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7600_p", "source_sha256": "d8b8316a623017968a53fa44fc0e69fd9f023ff68dc1253400dba8b8dcea0004", "ja": "山の中で暮らすイエティなんだし、元気が一番かな！\nそれに翼らしさもあって魅力的に見えるはずだ。", "zh": "毕竟是生活在山里的雪人，充满活力才是最重要的吧！\n而且这样也很有翼的风格，看起来一定很有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7601_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a1215d47bd5dbe890593ac1ad6b9263dbacb34da2c78a1ca77539d09c5bddfe7", "ja": "わあ～、そうかも！　でも、元気いっぱいなだけだと\nちょっと物足りなくないですか～？", "zh": "哇～，好像确实是这样！不过，如果只是充满活力的话，\n是不是总觉得有点不够呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_7602_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f88089bab060a2883aecce5739f8c2466de2f50c97ae0c579961a89c2fad5e72", "ja": "{$P$}さん、他に何かないですか？\nわたしをもっと、カワイイイエティにしてくださーい♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，还有别的吗？\n请把我变成更加可爱的雪怪吧——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
